---
// src/pages/legal/terms.astro
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/StorefrontLayout.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout
  title="Terms of Service | DEYNOLD DANNY"
  description="Client service conditions, order terms, and intellectual property."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <article class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 pb-24 text-neutral-800 font-light leading-relaxed">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 font-mono">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">Home</a>
          </li>
          <li class="select-none">/</li>
          <li class="text-neutral-900 font-medium" aria-current="page">
            Terms of Service
          </li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-8">
        <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-mono text-neutral-400 block mb-2">
          Atelier Conditions
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight text-neutral-900 font-serif">
          Terms & Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono mt-2">Effective Date: January 1, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-serif text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-wide">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By commissioning bespoke garments or acquiring pieces from DEYNOLD DANNY, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms of purchase and craftsmanship standards.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-serif text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-wide">2. Handcrafted Quality & Natural Fibers</h2>
          <p>
            Each piece in the DEYNOLD DANNY collection is crafted using fine natural fibers including virgin wool, Mongolian cashmere, and Como silk. Subtle variances in natural fiber texture and hand-feel are hallmarks of bespoke artisanal production.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-serif text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-wide">3. Order Acceptance & Pricing</h2>
          <p>
            Prices are displayed in Indian Rupees (INR ₹) or Euros (€) inclusive of applicable taxes unless specified otherwise. We reserve the right to decline or cancel orders in cases of obvious typographical errors or inventory allocation anomalies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-serif text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-wide">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            All designs, photography, monogram marks, and editorial narratives remain the exclusive intellectual property of DEYNOLD DANNY. Unauthorized reproduction is strictly prohibited.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</StorefrontLayout>
